    feat: bounded retry for Feign RetryableException in OrderServiceImpl
    
    placeOrder() and viewAllProducts() now retry a Feign call up to 3 total
    attempts (1 initial + 2 retries) with a fixed 200ms backoff when it fails
    with feign.RetryableException (true unreachable-service case), instead of
    falling straight to 503 on the first failure. The general FeignException
    branch (real HTTP error responses) is untouched.
    
    docs: record decision-005 documenting the retry design and the
    human-approved retry/backoff values.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

